1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,240
Listen to an announcement by a university administration.

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:09,070
We apologize for the cold temperatures in campus buildings today.

3
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:12,080
Overnight, a large steam pipe failed.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:18,180
The entire steam distribution system must be temporarily shut down to allow for repairs to the pipe.

5
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:23,260
Unfortunately, this means that most buildings are currently without heat and hot water.

6
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:28,290
Science Lab buildings have their own backup systems and should be unaffected.

7
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:33,090
Please remember that the use of electric heaters is prohibited.

8
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:35,796
These can overload buildings, electrical systems,

9
00:00:35,796 --> 00:00:37,270
and cause a power outage.

10
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:41,160
We'll update everyone when Steam service is restored.
